"answer": "Project Zenith is a strategic initiative that has recently secured a partnership with TechInnovate for AI research. The project team is expanding with five new members specializing in cybersecurity and cloud architecture. Key milestones include the successful completion of the testing phase and the successful testing of a secure file sharing prototype, which was achieved ahead of schedule. The project has received a $2M budget approval from the executive board, with an additional $55,000 allocated for a compliance plan. Current activities include gathering innovative ideas from R&D by July 20th to enhance data visualization tools using AI, planning user interface enhancements for October, and seeking stakeholder feedback on the prototype by the end of November. Security protocols, including multi-factor authentication and encryption, will be updated starting next January. A celebration for the milestone is scheduled for October 10th."
